Scope: this LICENSE covers only the parts created in this repository for
AWAI-3803 and nothing else:

- coverage/attribute-crosswalk.edn (self-made attribute-name map)
- bin/verify-attribute-crosswalk.cljk (verifier for that map)
- the README.md section describing them

It does not cover data/ (statistics projected from third-party public
sources under per-source attributes), schema/energy.edn,
coverage/registry.edn, coverage/country-code-kinds.edn, storage/ or any
other file. Those keep whatever terms their sources and authors gave
them.

